You know?

16:41.364 --> 16:44.761
Just checking in.
How was that mushroom risotto?

16:44.863 --> 16:46.637
-CHARLIE: It was so good.
-It was really, really good.

16:46.739 --> 16:47.905
-Yeah.
-COORDINATOR: Yeah?

16:48.008 --> 16:50.270
