-RACHEL: Cheers!

17:19.598 --> 17:22.171
-(MIKE LAUGHS)
-RACHEL: Love you guys.

17:22.273 --> 17:24.235
You know, I barely touched
the food at our wedding.

17:24.338 --> 17:25.908
-Too much adrenaline.
-Yeah.

17:26.010 --> 17:27.205
And then
we ran around at 2:00 a.m.

17:27.307 --> 17:29.278
