18:26.534 --> 18:28.302
-That could be great vibes.
-(EMMA CHUCKLES)

18:28.404 --> 18:30.204
-'Cause that's party vibes.
-Party vibes.

18:30.306 --> 18:31.803
-Exactly.
-It might be a little fun!

18:31.905 --> 18:35.673
