19:51.323 --> 19:53.218
-It was really exhausting...
-Don't sugarcoat it.

19:53.320 --> 19:54.554
Okay, I'm just saying,

19:54.656 --> 19:57.628
you know, the vibes
were already off, all right?

19:57.730 --> 19:58.755
So, okay, anyway,

19:58.857 --> 20:01.030
um, one night we're walking home
from a bar.

20:01.132 --> 20:02.798
This was actually
on her birthday.

20:02.900 --> 20:05.369
Um, yeah, and, uh...

20:05.471 --> 20:08.270
we're cutting through this
back alley to get to our place,

20:08.372 --> 20:13.277
and this dog comes
out of nowhere, barking.

20:13.379 --> 20:17.514
And no owner in sight.
Just a wild, crazy street dog.

20:17.617 --> 20:19.181
And, um...

20:19.283 --> 20:22.252
instinctively,
she starts kicking at it,

20:22.354 --> 20:24.686
which only makes the dog
more aggressive, and...

20:24.788 --> 20:25.516
Right.

20:25.618 --> 20:27.889
...it actually
starts biting her.

20:27.991 --> 20:29.652
And what did you do?

20:29.754 --> 20:32.392
-(CHARLIE CHUCKLES SOFTLY)
-Um...

20:32.494 --> 20:33.757
I kinda sorta
just moved behind...

20:33.859 --> 20:35.865
