a difference, really.

20:47.313 --> 20:49.308
What a horrible
little piece of shit you were.

20:49.410 --> 20:50.575
RACHEL: Oh, no, he still is.

20:50.677 --> 20:52.880
Yeah, okay.
Let's hear yours, then.

20:52.982 --> 20:54.411
No, I regret it.

20:54.513 --> 20:56.080
No, Rachel, you have to.

20:56.849 --> 20:58.921
I can't! No, I can't.
I'm sorry, I can't.

20:59.023 --> 20:59.882
If you don't tell them,

20:59.985 --> 21:01.958
