21:06.394 --> 21:07.994
(EMMA, CHARLIE CHUCKLE SOFTLY)

21:08.096 --> 21:09.099
Okay, she...

21:09.201 --> 21:11.365
I locked a kid in a closet.
(SNICKERS)

21:11.467 --> 21:13.296
-Okay.
-No, come on, the full story.

21:13.398 --> 21:14.833
All right, so...

21:14.935 --> 21:18.635
(CHUCKLES) I had this really
weird neighbor growing up.

21:18.737 --> 21:21.174
He was a few years
younger than me.

21:21.276 --> 21:23.212
He was a little slow.

21:23.314 --> 21:26.446
And he came over
to my house one day

21:26.548 --> 21:28.314
wanting to show me
some abandoned RV

21:28.417 --> 21:30.551
that he had found in the woods.

21:30.653 --> 21:32.483
And I don't know,
I must have been bored that day

21:32.585 --> 21:34.750
because I just went with it.

21:34.852 --> 21:37.091
And it was really
out of the way.

21:37.193 --> 21:38.822
Like, deep in the forest.

21:38.924 --> 21:41.699
And when we got there,
it was disgusting.

21:41.801 --> 21:42.728
It smelled bad,

21:42.830 --> 21:46.629
and there was beer bottles
and porn everywhere.

21:46.732 --> 21:48.532
