search party going.

22:52.667 --> 22:55.031
-You left him there overnight?
-Yeah.

22:55.133 --> 22:57.171
But they found him.
They found him. Don't worry.

22:57.273 --> 22:59.638
He's alive! He's alive.

22:59.740 --> 23:01.278
