asked me about it,

23:01.381 --> 23:02.843
and it never came back to me,
for some reason.

23:02.945 --> 23:05.112
CHARLIE: Yeah, 'cause he was
terrified of you obviously.

23:05.214 --> 23:06.450
RACHEL: Yeah. Maybe.

23:06.552 --> 23:09.415
Well, what would you have done
if they hadn't found him?

23:09.517 --> 23:11.318
Oh, I would have said something.

23:11.420 --> 23:12.687
It kinda sounds like you didn't.

23:12.789 --> 23:14.723
Well, they found him.
I didn't have to say anything.

23:14.825 --> 23:17.386
-What's yours, then, Charlie?
-RACHEL: Yeah, come on, Charlie.

23:17.488 --> 23:18.660
Oh, um...

23:19.694 --> 23:21.023
What's the worst thing
I've ever done?

23:21.125 --> 23:23.761
And don't fuck around, man.
The worst one.

23:23.863 --> 23:25.095
MIKE: Mm-hm.
RACHEL: Don't bullshit us.

23:25.596 --> 23:26.699
CHARLIE: I...

23:26.802 --> 23:30.603
(SIGHS) Fuck. I... I don't know.
I don't know.

23:30.705 --> 23:32.672
I don't know.
I honestly don't know.

23:32.774 --> 23:34.711
No, fuck that.
You have to say something.

23:34.813 --> 23:36.512
Um...

23:36.614 --> 23:39.513
Um... (STUTTERS, TAPS)
...I cyberbullied someone

23:39.615 --> 23:41.180
