23:56.366 --> 23:58.795
(SOFTLY) Yeah. Yeah. Like, yeah.

23:58.897 --> 24:00.601
(LAUGHS)
But when I think about it,

24:00.703 --> 24:02.798
it could have been
a coincidence. (STAMMERS)

24:02.900 --> 24:04.067
MIKE: Lame.
RACHEL: Come on.

24:04.169 --> 24:05.670
CHARLIE: But they did move.
And he was crying!

24:05.772 --> 24:07.109
I made him cry
a bunch of times.

24:07.211 --> 24:09.007
You were 14! Who cares?

24:09.109 --> 24:11.641
Your brain doesn't even
fully develop until you're 25.

24:11.743 --> 24:13.250
