ganging up on me today?

24:15.081 --> 24:16.719
-I didn't say anything.
-MIKE: Yeah, that's true.

24:16.821 --> 24:19.015
-Thank you, Emma. You're sweet.
-Oh, Emma. What about Emma?

24:19.118 --> 24:21.852
I didn't mean...
No, I think you were still...

24:21.954 --> 24:23.389
No, no, no, no.
He's disqualified.

24:23.491 --> 24:24.525
We're moving on. Come on.

24:24.627 --> 24:25.923
Yeah, come on,
give us something good.

24:26.025 --> 24:28.796
-Give us some hot tea, Emma.
-(EMMA GROANS)

24:30.001 --> 24:31.469
(MIKE LAUGHS)

24:31.936 --> 24:32.932
EMMA: Hm.

24:37.008 --> 24:38.036
(CHUCKLES)

